' PAL — State diagram for UC-05: RentalRequest lifecycle
@startuml PAL_State_UC05_RentalRequest

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #444
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FDF6E3
skinparam StateBorderColor #333
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #888
hide empty description

title UC-05 — RentalRequest state machine

[*] --> Pending : / submit request (UC-04)

Pending : entry / notify lender (push + email)
Pending : do / wait for lender decision

Pending --> Approved : lender approves [within deadline]\n/ reserve slot, notify borrower
Pending --> Rejected : lender rejects\n/ notify borrower, release slot
Pending --> Expired : deadline elapsed (24h)\n/ auto-reject, notify both parties

Approved : entry / hold AvailabilitySlot for borrower
Approved --> [*] : borrower paid (UC-06)\n/ becomes Booking (PaidPickupPending)

Rejected --> [*]
Expired  --> [*]

note bottom of Pending
  Source: UC-05 Basic Flow steps 3–5,
  Alternative Flow 3a (auto-reject after 24h).
  Deadline default 24h; configurable per UC-05 alt 3a.
end note

note right of Approved
  Cross-UC edge:
  the exit Approved → [*] is taken
  when UC-06 captures the rental-fee
  + deposit Payment.
end note

@enduml
